NOTE: CMS mails Form 40-B to individuals who receive the general enrollment period (GEP) mailing. Beneficiaries who receive the GEP mailing can use Form CMS-40B to enroll in SMI during the GEP. For information on GEP enrollment processing, see WB 00601.001.

